  "text": "24/7 Emergency Vet & Animal Specialty | Animal Specialty Center\nSkip to Primary Content\nBook\nContact Us\nMap\n9 Odell Plaza,\nYonkers,\nNY,\n10701\nCall\n(914) 457-4000\nEmergency\nEmergency\nPhone:\n(914) 457-4000\nAddress:\n9 Odell Plaza,\nYonkers,\nNY,\n10701\nOur Team\nServices\nCardiology\nDermatology\nEmergency\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nRadiation Oncology\nSurgery\nPet Owners\nReferring Veterinarians\nCareer Growth\nEmergency\nContact Us\nSurgery\nWe treat a variety of injuries and illnesses with orthopedic and soft tissue surgical interventions. Our compassionate surgical team is here to support you and your pet every step of the way.\nLearn More\nAnimal Specialty Center\nThe ASC team is committed to providing expert and compassionate 24/7 emergency care, as well as high-quality medical and surgical care.\nRegistration Form\nNeurology\nThe Veterinary Neurologists at ASC are here for you and your pet. Our team can help treat conditions affecting the brain, spinal cord, peripheral nerves, and muscles.\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nSurgery\nWe treat a variety of injuries and illnesses with orthopedic and soft tissue surgical interventions. Our compassionate surgical team is here to support you and your pet every step of the way.\nLearn More\nAnimal Specialty Center\nThe ASC team is committed to providing expert and compassionate 24/7 emergency care, as well as high-quality medical and surgical care.\nRegistration Form\nNeurology\nThe Veterinary Neurologists at ASC are here for you and your pet. Our team can help treat conditions affecting the brain, spinal cord, peripheral nerves, and muscles.\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nSurgery\nWe treat a variety of injuries and illnesses with orthopedic and soft tissue surgical interventions. Our compassionate surgical team is here to support you and your pet every step of the way.\nLearn More\nWelcome to Animal Specialty Center\nPROUDLY SERVING PETS AND PET OWNERS. LOCATED IN YONKERS, NY, FOR OVER 14 YEARS.\nOur primary mission is keeping pet owners and their beloved pets together, while enjoying longer, happier, and healthier lives. Animal Specialty Center is a 16,000 square-foot 24-hour emergency and specialty veterinary hospital serving Yonkers, White Plains, Tarrytown, Ossining, Scarsdale, Bronxville, and Westchester County Since 2008. Our care team consists of compassionate board-certified Veterinary Specialists, Emergency Doctors, Licensed Veterinary Nurses, and Veterinary Assistants.\nInternal Medicine\nCardiology\nDermatology\nEmergency\nInternal Medicine\nCardiology\nDermatology\nEmergency\nInternal Medicine\nCardiology\nDermatology\nEmergency\nInternal Medicine\nSurgery\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology\nRadiation Oncology\nSurgery\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology\nRadiation Oncology\nSurgery\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology\nRadiation Oncology\nSurgery\nClient Reviews & Testimonials\nWe serve Westchester and Rockland Counties, Manhattan, Bronx, Northern New Jersey, and Connecticut. We value our clients’ experience at the Animal Specialty Center. Since 2008 we've cared for hundreds of pets. Here’s what their owners are saying about us.\nAnimal Specialty Center\n9 Odell Plaza\nYonkers\n,\nNY\n10701\nT:\n(914) 457-4000\nF:\n(914) 457-4001\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nContact Us\nOur Team\nCareer Growth\nPet Owners\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
